Error: Invalid --group-by value: 'invalid'

Suggestion: Use one of: file, similarity, type, or size
           Example: polydup scan ./src --group-by file

Options explained:
  • file       - Group by source file (refactoring prioritization)
  • similarity - Sort by match quality (highest first)
  • type       - Group by Type-1/Type-2/Type-3
  • size       - Sort by duplicate length (largest first)
